  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responding to urgent and transitional needs of affected communities in northern, central and southern Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali continues to face a complex, multi-faceted crisis that is driving multi-sectoral humanitarian needs across the country, particularly in the Northern and Central regions where most of the country&apos;s hotbeds of conflict and violence are located. This project aims to respond to urgent and transitional needs resulting from population displacement in Northern and Southern Mali by reducing vulnerabilities and improving the protection and living conditions of displaced populations and host communities, with a special emphasis on women and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
